| **Vulnerability**               | **Recommendation**                                                                 |
|----------------------------------|------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| Injection                        | Use `express-validator`, sanitize inputs, parameterized queries.                  |
| Broken Authentication           | Add JWT/OAuth2, rate limiting.                                                     |
